WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.759
Over there, if you look at how the trees
are planted, you'll see that there used to

2
00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:12.950
be a path for horse riding,

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.950
from the days when people went
out riding, between the wars.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.672
Have you ever noticed why there's such a
wide strip between the pavement and the

5
00:00:30.722 --> 00:00:32.950
road on Kiseleff?

6
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.950
People rode their horses
along there, on both sides.

7
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.950
And where did they stop?

8
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.950
At the intersection with Kiseleff.

9
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.950
Over there, on the left,
there's a honey locust tree.

10
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.950
Big and sturdy.

11
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:07.950
And there's another one at the junction
of Mahatma Gandhi Street and Kiseleff.

12
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.950
Those two are the last survivors of
a whole grove of honey locust trees

13
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.950
that once grew in the area.

14
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:29.950
In the same way, from Docenților
towards the Triumphal Arch, on the left,

15
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.950
you'll see a big house that's in ruins now.

16
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.950
And yes, it was abandoned.

17
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.950
General Miclescu, who served in
the Royal Guard, lived there.

18
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.950
And the royal entourage used
to visit General Miclescu,

19
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:56.529
who had a ballroom right in the middle
of the house, under a glass dome that has

20
00:01:56.579 --> 00:01:57.950
since caved in.

21
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.950
It was a different world.

